<title>NEW ZEALAND: Goodman completes Defiance NZ buy.</title>
<headline>Goodman completes Defiance NZ buy.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goodman Fielder said on Monday it had completed the acquisition of milling and baking operations of Defiance Foods Industries in New Zealand following finalisation of all sale processes.</p>
<p>The former operations of Defiance Food Industries will now trade as Country Fare and Defiance Flour Mills, both divisions of Goodman Fielder Milling and Baking NZ.</p>
<p>New Zealand's Commerce Commission regulator cleared a revised bid by the giant Australian foods group two weeks ago, subject to Goodman divesting certain milling assets.</p>
</text>
